msgid "Affects whether backface culling is enabled for the active camera. In Blender 4.1 or lower, this setting controls the legacy 'Backface Culling' setting"
msgstr "影响活动相机是否启用背面剔除。在 Blender 4.1 或更低版本中，此设置控制旧版「背面剔除」设置"

